ugh I recorded with her  and we finished that and we did the mix  even up into the last day before I had  to deliver the album I totally remixed  the record changed the instrumentation  because I felt like it wasn't modern  enough what I'd done and so I worked  with a different producer on creating a  new a new arrangement for the song  mm-hmm and that's what's on the record  in fact if you're if you're curious the  vinyl the original vinyl record which is  coming out in March I think there's a  limited edition of it I don't know how  many records there are only the cover is  different and the music the inside the  records differ and that has their very  original mix with Jenny and I and then  that's gonna fade out because the new  version is taking over so Wow yeah hi  what's your definition of success I  don't know I don't really think about  that you don't know yeah you just love  making music well it's it's it can't  help myself yes it's always trying to  find the next thing and what's what  we're gonna do so  you

